Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's yours. Today's dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He got me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:37.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It'll heal right away, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:46.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:54.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:04.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I went as far as I could go, but there's nothing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No islands, no boats, no land masses?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing man-made?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.33,0:01:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:14.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just the same ocean,\Nextending forever in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:24.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That we're still not back in our original world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.30,0:01:30.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like when the school was enveloped in darkness,\Nwe're in yet {\i1}another{\i0} world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we sure are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mizuho?\NAre you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:46.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was after one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you know, she wears makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:55.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine now. I mean, she can order\Nanything she wants, regardless of price.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a month since we started transmitting an SOS,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we haven't received any responses,\Nlet alone been rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still have internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:15.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but all web pages are frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus we can't send anything to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:22.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's still the possibility that someone will come to rescue us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I believe there's another way to get us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Other worlds may provide clues for our return,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or even lead us straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not long ago, other gateways were discovered,\Nthanks to Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These gateways that he stumbled upon inside the school\Nled to various other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, those worlds are all places that boggle the mind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and reject the presence of us humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:03:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does that lead us to a way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First of all,\Nhere on this island, anything that breaks\Nstays broken, no matter how long you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what about over at the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:15.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In there, if something breaks, if you wait for a little while,\Nit returns to normal, as if nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a result, we can continue to use the power and water,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the emergency food supplies are a veritable buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:25.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, we, along with the school, are in a state of stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So even when we get hurt,\Nour wounds are healed before we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:32.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almost as if nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which led me to wonder—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the school and the island are totally different worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the same goes for the {\i1}other{\i0} new worlds that we found.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:47.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So maybe the discovery of these worlds is the same phenomenon as what made us drift in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if we retrace that phenomenon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:52.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did this drift occur?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:58.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we'll arrive at what caused all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And before the world sinks, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Did you get burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Water, somebody! Go get some water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:32.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Water! I brought water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? There's a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't take this. I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:55.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More of that blue fire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.89,0:04:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have any idea what's causing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still don't know anything about this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to ensure we take care of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:19.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. No trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:35.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The student council president was wondering if you knew\Nwhen those supplies would arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like it'll be a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How much is a little? A day? Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell her it's three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,earlier, in the woods...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.51,0:06:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that? I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tora?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did we...\Nget stuck doing this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What choice did we have? There's nothing else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa!\NLook at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It happened again!\NIt's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, this island must have a demon living on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think that's what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sure does burn in the weirdest way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.03,0:07:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think it might be someone's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:07.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mizuho might know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:08.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah? How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw her in the woods earlier,\N standing in front of a burning tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:15.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was this same kind of blue fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rajdhani!\NAre you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet Mizuho is doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:39.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, everything that's burning\Nis stuff that Mizuho's power has produced, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\Nthose tools that started burning were also...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you were just saying that you saw Mizuho burning a tree in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:49.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I said—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he saw it for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mizuho gave this hard glare,\Nand bam! This tree just caught fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it was a blue fire, at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:08:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't. What I said was—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That settles it, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:03.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't tell anything by just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to verify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go tell the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:09.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:29.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Info on the message board users.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? How did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:34.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked my grandpa's lawyer,\Nand had him file a disclosure request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I took a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and here she is, from our class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:53.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a pretty intense look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't let this go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:03.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, there were extenuating\Ncircumstances—on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just hand-waving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:09.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are times when just being right isn't always for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:14.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still... I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:15.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,maybe it's a good thing you're still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:24.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:29.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tora! Where are you?! Tora!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's been\Nposting about me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Denying it won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:51.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have proof that you're the one behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's the privileged class for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You operate differently, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:58.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Retract what you said, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:01.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?\NIt's the truth, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with stating facts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? How can you shrug this off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he knows that you used the library's Wi-Fi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.49,0:10:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to slander one of your fellow students.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You say that—but as a teacher, he's still liable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you apologize to the student council president?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,—t up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that? I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:32.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong. {\i1}You{\i0} apologize to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:41.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this? Those blue fires are Mizuho's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard it was a curse she invoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of us understand what she's thinking.\NIt's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatcha up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:16.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's... nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the same as the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That day, when we first started drifting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:35.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you left another bird to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.26,0:11:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I was in a hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:57.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, they say it's not good to do anything if you don't know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:11:58.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right. I just let it die\Nbecause I'm a heartless person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:05.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that what you want to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:10.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you know? You talk like you know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:18.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but is being abandoned by someone\Nany reason for abandoning someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.\NGood to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have a question for you. Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you behind the blue fires?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm only asking this for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To give you a chance to earn back our trust—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.93,0:12:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, we don't want you to have a repeat of the mishap with Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you group me in with that brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:13:00.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of your lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:02.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:05.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just want to protect you, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless you change your ways,\Nthat's what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you figure anything out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:27.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That there's a "PocketGame".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a portable game device from way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got it from Mizuho in exchange for some toys I made for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing that didn't burn up in the fire earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:42.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which intrigued me, and got me thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:46.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the difference between what burned,\Nand what didn't burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... So what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably whether it was traded for, or taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:57.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was something that was exchanged in a fair trade between Mizuho and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:01.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the rest of it was stuff I got from Mizuho without compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:02.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're talking cash, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How would you like this special item?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're asking me {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.67,0:14:09.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, just take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Ow, hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This fire just {\i1}feels{\i0} hot—it doesn't do us any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, Mizuho's things aren't all that burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.39,0:14:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made that toy using {\i1}my {\i0}power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:40.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:44.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the fires aren't Mizuho's fault after all, huh?\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So is this another of this world's rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are still many unknown elements in play,\Nand I can't say anything for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:58.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then again...\NI'd say I've deduced that Mizuho isn't the culprit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even still, I wish she would come out and say so herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all too dependent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both on her, and on this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tora!\NAre you back yet? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NThat's Tora's dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,still doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:29.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can't live on his own yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:33.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'll just show sincere remorse\Nand offer an apology for everything you've done up to now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all work together to rise above this difficult situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll give you until noon tomorrow. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you see earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.73,0:16:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to lose someone dear to you again by doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:22.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's such a simple thing. Just one phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'd just said it,\Nyou wouldn't have lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, you gotta be quick before it's all gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good. You can have this one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:51.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. There isn't really anything I want anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks! You're a great guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and no take backs—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:16:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My money!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:03.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mizuho is behind this!\NWe should get rid of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, she isn't the one doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These fires are part of the island's rules,\Nand if we pay for things, they won't burn up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to do\Nsomething about this, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:32.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Mizuho's cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.31,0:17:33.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Catnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:36.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's hurt, and in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:42.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? And what have you done with the real Nagara?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my fault that everyone is distrustful of Mizuho.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:51.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NLet's take him back to Mizuho.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We run.\NFast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all a bunch of liars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.53,0:18:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that everyone is blaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I said something misleading, they all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really. They would have started to blame me sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:39.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your cat was in the woods, unable to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.48,0:19:00.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, so how long are you planning on sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not burning everything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you speak up already and—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've known I should since all this started!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that there wasn't\Nanything I could do by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't live here anymore, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It turns out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we aren't able to change the world after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:13.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The island's gone back to the way it was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to Asakaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the fires...\Nwere not caused by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although...\NI was the one who made it rain money,\Nand set the island on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:38.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:39.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.71,0:20:44.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So for that much, at least, I'll apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.25,0:20:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.73,0:20:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the rest of it isn't my fault, okay? Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:20:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So let's review...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:04.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happens if you get something on this island without paying for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.05,0:21:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It burns up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But as long as that's the way it works,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we have to accept it, and live with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:22.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So today, I'm announcing a revolutionary new app,\Nwhich will allow us to adapt to life in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:24.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hyo{\i0}-ryu-coin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:30.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an electronic payment service
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that allows you to create ledgers,\Nand make asset transactions over the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By using this, we won't be\Ntransgressing the island's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to exchange goods without having them catch fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:21:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To thank you for saving my cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.44,0:22:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we have to settle it. How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a present, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.56,0:22:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting this world to go back to the way it was, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.99,0:22:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:41.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Just like...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.89,0:22:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The place we're supposed to go home to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I could just about reach out and touch it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but right now, it's just a pinpoint, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:22:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Compass".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's my power.
